  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Split PH progr 04-10 - Univ Colombo 04-10</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Split PhD program 04-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r ett st&#xf6;d till 12 personer anst&#xe4;llda vid olika universitet p&#xe5; Sri Lanka, att doktorera inom IT omr&#xe5;det. utbildningen sker genom en s&#xe5; kallad sandwich-modell d&#xe4;r en del av utbildningen sker i Sverige och en del p&#xe5; Sri lanka. St&#xf6;d skall &#xe4;ven utg&#xe5; till 8 personer som f&#xe5;tt st&#xf6;d genom ett tidigare IT projekt, f&#xf6;r att de skall kunna avsluta sina doktorand studier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the training of 12 staff members selected from Sri Lankan Universities towards split Ph.D. at collaborating universities in Sweden. This is expected to support capacity building in IT in the participating Sri Lankan Universities. Certain amounts of funds have also been utilized for the completion of the 8 Ph.D. students who was part of the previous Sida-IT project.</narrative>
  </description>
